    "body": "## Scope\n\nAdd five presentation-only generational color themes without changing runtime logic, copy, mechanics, state, persistence, economy, dependencies, or Stage 7.\n\nExact changed files:\n- `AsyncScene/AsyncScene.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/style.css`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/style-base.css`\n- `AsyncScene/Web/ui-profile-themes.css`\n- `docs/style.css`\n- `docs/style-base.css`\n- `docs/ui-profile-themes.css`\n- `tools/test_stage6_1_generational_color_themes.py`\n\n## Architecture\n\n- Existing public `style.css` becomes a two-import loader.\n- Accepted pre-theme CSS is preserved byte-for-byte as `style-base.css`.\n- `ui-profile-themes.css` loads after the base and uses existing `body[data-ui-profile]` wiring.\n- Xcode resource wiring includes both imported CSS files for bundle parity.\n- Source/docs loader, base, and theme pairs are byte-identical.\n\n## Theme contract\n\n- Boomer: warm cream, burgundy, deep blue, brass; compact formal geometry.\n- Gen X: charcoal, rust, muted teal; angular hardware-panel geometry.\n- Millennial: warm light surfaces, indigo, teal, dusty rose; soft card geometry.\n- Zoomer: dark violet, cyan, restrained lime; controlled neon depth.\n- Alpha: bright aqua, coral, violet, yellow; larger light tactile geometry.\n- Semantic battle-strength, danger, reward, and disabled colors are not overridden.\n- Reduced-motion and forced-colors fallbacks are included.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Exact branch theme blob `184b697663e2c2da2443c532bf7488398cf35913` was reconstructed locally byte-for-byte and parsed by `tinycss2 1.5.1`: 60 top-level rules, zero syntax errors.\n- Contrast ratios, main / primary:\n  - Boomer `14.83 / 8.73`\n  - Gen X `11.65 / 5.36`\n  - Millennial `14.64 / 5.04`\n  - Zoomer `16.22 / 5.18`\n  - Alpha `15.56 / 5.55`\n- Loader mirrors: blob `d875ef9b4742442aa8a3180fccd501a4c9af9519`.\n- Preserved base mirrors: original blob `738398815ed6ca310a5e3dee0dbea2cd24729e89`.\n- Theme mirrors: blob `184b697663e2c2da2443c532bf7488398cf35913`.\n- Xcode diff is exactly two file references, two build files, two Web-group members, and two Resources-phase members.\n- Repository has no applicable CI workflow for this path set; final live visual acceptance remains a Safari gate after deployment.\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Stage 6 remains previously accepted; this is a separate Stage 6.1 visual enhancement.\n- Stage 7 remains historical and inactive.\n- Do not declare final theme acceptance before live Safari review of all five profiles.",
